ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  non-smoker\n-  no temporomandibular joint (TMJ) disorder or facial pain\n-  having partcipated in the original study (1993 - 1996) at which time the mnimum participate age was 25 years and the maximum 56 years.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "-"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "NOT": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "non-smoker",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "smoker"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "smoker"\n                  ],\n                  "Negation": [\n                    "non"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "-"\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "NOT": {\n                "left": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "no temporomandibular joint (TMJ) disorder",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "disorder"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "disorder"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "temporomandibular joint",\n                        "TMJ"\n                      ],\n                      "Negation": [\n       