ictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patients who have had previous orthopedic treatment\n-  Patients with signs of condyle injuries\n-  Patients of Pierre Robin or any form of cleft\n-  Patients with syndromes that associate craniofacial anomalies and muscle alterations.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients who have had previous orthopedic treatment",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "orthopedic treatment"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "orthopedic treatment"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Comparison": [\n                "previous"\n              ],\n              "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                "previous"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients with signs of condyle injuries",\n              "Observation": [\n                "signs"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "signs"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "condyle"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "injuries"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "injuries"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Patients of Pierre Robin",\n              "Condition": [\n                "Pierre Robin"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "Pierre Robin"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "or any form of cleft",\n              "Condition": [\n                "cleft"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "cleft"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients with syndromes that associate craniofacial anomalies",\n          "Condition": [\n            "syndromes",\n            "craniofacial anomalies"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "syndromes",\n            "craniofacial anomalies"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "and muscle alterations.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "muscle alterations"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "muscle alterations"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
